NOTE ON DATA / 数据声明

本仓库中的代码采用 MIT 许可。

仓库内 data 目录下的 CSV 文件是对 MOOCCube 数据集的子集抽取与格式转换结果。
MOOCCube 由清华大学知识工程实验室（THU-KEG）以 CC0-1.0 许可发布，原始数据
可自由使用与再分发。引用时请同时标注：

  Yu, Jifan, et al. "MOOCCube: A Large-Scale Data Repository for NLP
  Applications in MOOCs." Proceedings of the 58th Annual Meeting of the
  Association for Computational Linguistics, 2020, pp. 2357-2366.

The code in this repository is licensed under MIT.

The CSV files under the data directory are a subset extraction and format
conversion of the MOOCCube dataset, which is released by THU-KEG under the
CC0-1.0 license. Please cite the paper above when redistributing.
